    &lt;span&gt;${legendSquare("white", "rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.8)")} Inconsistent&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;&lt;svg width="16" height="16" style="vertical-align: -3px;"&gt;&lt;circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" fill="none" stroke="${blue}" stroke-width="2.5"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; Reported mean and SD&lt;/span&gt;`
  return html`&lt;p style="font-weight: 600; margin: 0.8rem 0 0.2rem 0;"&gt;${message}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;"&gt;Attainable means are ${(1 / nk).toFixed(4)} apart${nk &gt;= 10 ** d ? `, which is no wider than the ${d}-decimal reporting steps, so no mean can fail GRIM` : ""}.&lt;/p&gt;
