    &lt;div class="ga-status"&gt;${rows.length} row${rows.length === 1 ? "" : "s"}: ${summary}. ${cannotFail &gt; 0 ? html`GRIM was uninformative for ${cannotFail} row${cannotFail === 1 ? "" : "s"}: with this sample size and number of items averaged, every value at the reported number of decimals is attainable, so GRIM could not have failed (see &lt;a href="#sec-grim-uninformative"&gt;When GRIM is uninformative&lt;/a&gt;).` : ""} Rounding: ${roundingName.toLowerCase()}. Calculated by &lt;code&gt;grim_map()&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;grimmer_map()&lt;/code&gt; with scrutiny ${scrutinyVersion}, ${rVersion}, running in webR ${gaWebrVersion}.&lt;/div&gt;
